  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The role of civil society in building peace in Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grassroots communities particularly those who have suffered the most under years of conflict are an integral part of building peace in Colombia. The IAF supports community-led solutions to enhance peace and security and promote human rights in Colombia. Our grantee partner Fundacin Desarrollo y Paz (Fundepaz) supports three victims&apos; grassroots organizations in Nario department to contribute to building peace in their territories by increasing their capacity to monitor the implementation of the Colombian peace accords strengthen a regional advocacy center and contribute to the historical memory of Colombia&apos;s conflict. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s broader initiative to build a just and lasting peace in Colombia.</narrative>
  </description>
